{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome regrets, recover the words that need to be said, and escape from a parallel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How they met, their deep affection, the precious mundaneness of their daily lives... and their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories of Rachel is a text adventure game where you pick up keywords called fragments from the protagonist's memories and answer questions to advance the main story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/3c40797b722faf12aac42e28c9816092.poster.avif?t=1773404031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/3c40797b722faf12aac42e28c9816092.webm?t=1773404031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/3c40797b722faf12aac42e28c9816092.mp4?t=1773404031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/dc5d774ac5fc2ab8d399dd4248cc0a31.poster.avif?t=1773404031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/dc5d774ac5fc2ab8d399dd4248cc0a31.webm?t=1773404031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/dc5d774ac5fc2ab8d399dd4248cc0a31.mp4?t=1773404031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you read the game like a visual novel, vignette-like memories will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you answer questions using the keywords, the protagonist's secrets as well as what she must say to Rachel become clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's all there is to it. No sudden action sequences, no clicking on maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But their secrets and the overlap of memories will stick like a thorn in your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is Kaori Kashima, a second-year high school student.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She and her best friend Rachel are on their way home when suddenly, a person in a black hood appears and fatally stabs Rachel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somehow, Kaori acquires a time machine and manages to go back in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But she soon realizes something's different here\u2014it's a parallel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rachel is alive and well, but Kaori feels she must return to the original timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where and when did this parallel world split off?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Searching her memories for answers, she attempts time travel again at the moment of divergence, but\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3031930?t=1773404031","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3031930?t=1773404031","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773404031","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773404031","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This work contains depictions of violence.\r\nSexual acts are not depicted, but may be suggested in scenarios."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome regrets, recover the words that need to be said, and escape from a parallel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How they met, their deep affection, the precious mundaneness of their daily lives... and their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories of Rachel is a text adventure game where you pick up keywords called fragments from the protagonist's memories and answer questions to advance the main story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/3c40797b722faf12aac42e28c9816092.poster.avif?t=1773404031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/3c40797b722faf12aac42e28c9816092.webm?t=1773404031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/3c40797b722faf12aac42e28c9816092.mp4?t=1773404031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/dc5d774ac5fc2ab8d399dd4248cc0a31.poster.avif?t=1773404031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/dc5d774ac5fc2ab8d399dd4248cc0a31.webm?t=1773404031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/extras/dc5d774ac5fc2ab8d399dd4248cc0a31.mp4?t=1773404031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you read the game like a visual novel, vignette-like memories will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you answer questions using the keywords, the protagonist's secrets as well as what she must say to Rachel become clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's all there is to it. No sudden action sequences, no clicking on maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But their secrets and the overlap of memories will stick like a thorn in your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is Kaori Kashima, a second-year high school student.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She and her best friend Rachel are on their way home when suddenly, a person in a black hood appears and fatally stabs Rachel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somehow, Kaori acquires a time machine and manages to go back in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But she soon realizes something's different here\u2014it's a parallel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rachel is alive and well, but Kaori feels she must return to the original timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where and when did this parallel world split off?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Searching her memories for answers, she attempts time travel again at the moment of divergence, but\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["SANDWICH KITCHEN"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031930/header.jpg?t=1773404031","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple\u30b7\u30